<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sandisk started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sandisk started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it started coverage of Sandisk Corp with near-term neutral and long-term accumulate ratings.</p>
<p>-- Further details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 14-3/4.</p>
</text>
